Comment: 50,0:23:53.04,0:23:53.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.08,0:00:24.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's so nice out on the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What an awesome party vacation!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.92,0:00:32.39,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Prez put this together to celebrate\Nthe success of our concert!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:32.39,0:00:34.68,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Should I be worried?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.81,0:00:39.81,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,It's a fancy island lodge.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.81,0:00:41.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.31,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yup, yup!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.31,0:00:46.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,President, I didn't know you could drive a boat!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.07,0:00:51.07,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I'm good at a lot of things,\Nso long as I can have fun doing them.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.41,0:00:53.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I can't wait to sit back and relax.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I couldn't catch a break even after the concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.75,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It brought us a lot of attention.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:58.75,0:01:00.46,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,It was amazing.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:01.12,0:01:06.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Anyway, while we're on vacation,\Nlet's forget about work and have some fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Gotta stay refreshed!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.51,0:01:11.47,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:16.81,0:01:18.98,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:20.06,0:01:21.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,A tornado?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.48,0:01:24.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's coming our way!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.02,0:01:25.23,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Oh gosh, oh gosh!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.18,0:03:17.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.64,0:03:24.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes, we're fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.02,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You two doing alright?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.61,0:03:31.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.28,0:03:35.40,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,There's no signal.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.82,0:03:37.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't find our boat either.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.86,0:03:41.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did the sea throw us out here?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.41,0:03:44.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? The President's not with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.29,0:03:45.62,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.62,0:03:48.71,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Knowing him, he probably is.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.71,0:03:49.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.17,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We should call for help.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.76,0:03:57.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's go see if anyone else is on this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.68,0:03:59.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.84,0:04:02.18,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,If anyone's there, say something!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.43,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.57,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.57,0:04:19.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like anyone lives on this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.78,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Could it be a desert island?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.58,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Huh? For real?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.41,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You mean we can't go home?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.41,0:04:29.62,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A desert island, like where you set up\Na campfire and go fishing?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.04,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sounds kinda fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You're so silly, Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to try surviving in the wild!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.13,0:04:38.09,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Surviving?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.09,0:04:39.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We can collect berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's fish too!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.59,0:04:42.80,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Any stores?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.39,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.14,0:04:49.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Until we figure out how to get home,\Nwe'll work together to survive!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.10,0:04:51.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's go look for food!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.31,0:04:56.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Stay by my side. Don't want anyone getting lost!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.11,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Toko-san, don't go that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.61,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.61,0:05:03.53,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This way's a no-go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.49,0:05:08.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,There could be dangerous animals too,\Nso don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.87,0:05:11.46,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.46,0:05:14.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A leaf fell down.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.80,0:05:17.13,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Toko-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.59,0:05:20.17,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I think I saw something here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.31,0:05:27.68,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Something? Like what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.68,0:05:28.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait there.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.85,0:05:31.10,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Is it okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.69,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.69,0:05:34.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's edible.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.49,0:05:43.78,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I can't eat something like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? But it's so cute! Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aw, so we can't?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.62,0:05:55.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,See you later, snakey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.17,0:06:00.72,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,For an idol, Lilly-san acts a lot like a little kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.42,0:05:57.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.22,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.72,0:06:08.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.73,0:06:19.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,There's no fish here, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.95,0:06:25.95,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Why did this have to happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.95,0:06:30.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Our vacation turned into a disaster.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.12,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Sure did.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.75,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.75,0:06:34.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.54,0:06:39.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What if we can't go home? Would you live here?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.47,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It'll be okay! I'm sure we can go home!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.47,0:06:47.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The President must be on the boat\Nsearching for us. I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.39,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.93,0:06:51.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.35,0:06:55.85,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Eh, it'll work out somehow.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.85,0:06:57.61,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's go check the shore over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.40,0:06:59.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.82,0:07:05.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Could this be...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It feels a lot like magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do you think, Azuki?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.20,0:07:14.66,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.66,0:07:17.04,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I'll look into it, Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.26,0:07:25.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Around here should be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.84,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Lilly, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.34,0:07:32.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Going to see if I can use magic to get us home!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.77,0:07:36.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula, someone come save us!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.06,0:07:40.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? Why didn't it work?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.61,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.61,0:07:44.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're gonna!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.71,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.04,0:07:56.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.29,0:08:04.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So, we got shipwrecked, you see.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.01,0:08:07.68,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,You're human, yes? Don't see those here often.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.80,0:08:10.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What about you, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.14,0:08:12.89,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,I'm from the land of magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.89,0:08:15.39,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,This is a magic island!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.27,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.19,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.61,0:08:24.23,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,I'm this island's fisherman.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.57,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,And this little one is...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.57,0:08:28.20,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,My name's Chapi! Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is Uguisu and Azuki.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.78,Default,Uguisu/Azuki,0,0,0,,– Hey.\N– Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.16,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Did you get caught in the storm yesterday?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.16,0:08:42.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We were all in the boat when the storm came,\Nthen we woke up on this island!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.79,0:08:48.42,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Some meteorites rained here lately,\Nand the seas have been stormier ever since.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.42,0:08:50.34,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Must be related.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.26,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Could that be...?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.26,0:08:57.10,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Away to the magic world with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.35,0:09:02.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It might've been that.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.02,0:09:07.69,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,I'd call for help, but my magic's only good for fishing.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.69,0:09:11.03,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,And the magic island's unstable.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.03,0:09:12.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Darn...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.24,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I can't use my magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.24,0:09:18.04,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.04,0:09:23.79,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,It could work in some spots,\Nbut I wouldn't hold your breath.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.79,0:09:24.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aw.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.30,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,You should get home soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.72,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,The next storm's gonna be a bad one.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.72,0:09:31.88,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,There's another storm coming?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.89,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Yeah, and when it does...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.89,0:09:36.31,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,this island will sink underwater!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.31,0:09:37.97,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.97,0:09:41.35,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Happens here all the time.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.69,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,The water's starting to rise.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.06,0:09:49.74,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,We live underwater! Wanna come see?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.74,0:09:52.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry, no. We'll drown.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.36,0:09:53.78,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I wanna go home...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.20,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.91,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'll find a spot where magic works!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.91,0:09:57.79,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.66,0:10:01.58,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Dad! Can I go with them?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.04,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Sure. Take care.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.58,0:10:04.75,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Can I come?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.75,0:10:05.84,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.84,0:10:06.79,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu... Azuki!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.21,0:10:13.34,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,We don't usually get involved with humans.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.34,0:10:15.93,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,You do what you can now.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.89,0:10:20.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,what {\i1}can{\i0} I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.98,0:10:29.02,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,No good here either.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.48,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,I'll do it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.20,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Chapi, be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.70,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.70,0:10:39.08,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Sorry, I messed up!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.37,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Let's go over there next!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.95,0:10:43.91,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.38,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Wow, so many.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But what kind of fruit are these?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.34,0:10:53.88,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Wonder if they're edible.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.26,0:10:59.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,How is it, Asahi?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.76,0:11:01.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is it sour? Bad?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.85,0:11:04.60,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,It's sweet! What a weird flavor.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That's good! Let's take some back.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.23,0:11:11.40,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Darn, another one got away.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.53,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,This is difficult.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.53,0:11:16.36,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's give up fishing and look for shellfish instead.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.29,0:11:27.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila, make us escape this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.67,0:11:34.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't use magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.55,0:11:36.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.14,0:11:41.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.90,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fish...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.73,0:11:53.53,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Where are you guys from?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.53,0:11:54.78,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Our home!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.24,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It's a confectionery!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.24,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Hm? Is that far away?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.57,0:12:00.74,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.03,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.75,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,No good here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.75,0:12:06.71,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.63,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.92,0:12:16.22,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,It's a boat!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.47,0:12:24.39,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Is it the one you came here on?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.39,0:12:25.31,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.31,0:12:26.60,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It's broken...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.23,0:12:29.31,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,So magic {\i1}is{\i0} our only option!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.02,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.56,0:12:33.52,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Try going to the mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.03,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.03,0:12:40.07,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,During the last storm, my dad was able\Nto use magic close by the mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.07,0:12:41.28,Default,Uguisu/Azuki,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.67,0:12:53.46,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,With all this, I think we should make it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.46,0:12:56.30,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's get dinner ready before the sun sets.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.96,0:13:01.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,If you arrange the firewood with\Nsome gaps, it burns a lot better.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.80,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wow, you know a lot about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I read about it in a book.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.81,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Oh, Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.94,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Where were you, Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.23,0:13:14.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.02,0:13:17.69,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright, let's eat dinner.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.95,0:13:22.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.12,0:13:27.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,These berries are very sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.84,0:13:37.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is the sea gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.43,0:13:48.14,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Everyone, I downloaded our concert.\NDo you wanna watch?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.68,0:13:51.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.60,0:13:54.27,Default,More:Once More,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We'll keep chasing our dreams
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.27,0:14:00.11,Default,More:Once More,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Shining and unbreakable like diamonds
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.15,0:14:03.20,Default,More:Once More,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I can't stop these feelings
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.20,0:14:06.08,Default,More:Once More,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want you to get them too
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.08,0:14:11.16,Default,More:Once More,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Sparking in brilliant colors
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.83,Default,More:Once More,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This Diamond Dream
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.15,0:13:59.49,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.49,0:14:03.74,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I feel so embarrassed watching it myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.62,0:14:06.33,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I get that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.33,0:14:10.41,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd get to be an idol.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.83,0:14:19.80,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,All of you at Once More made me so happy\Neven when I was just watching you alone at home.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.68,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Asahi-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're in this together now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.64,0:14:26.93,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Lilly-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.72,0:14:29.52,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What a beautiful story!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.68,0:14:35.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That storm won't get the best of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.94,0:14:39.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah! We gotta be around\Nto throw an even bigger concert!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.86,0:14:41.07,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I dream of the dome!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.24,0:14:44.70,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,I dream of the dome!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.57,0:14:47.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.91,0:14:51.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Come on, Lulu-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't help it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.58,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu, isn't everyone acting weird?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I dun think sho.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.67,0:15:03.42,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu, I know you like sweet things,\Nbut I think you've eaten too much.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.42,0:15:04.76,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You too, Toko?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.09,0:15:09.01,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Not to drag this up now, but seriously,\Nwho puts sugar on hamburg steak?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.01,0:15:12.52,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's yummy! You should try it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.02,0:15:15.06,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're all acting kind of weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.19,0:15:21.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.90,0:15:22.94,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.49,0:15:28.03,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Asahi, you secretly smelled Lilly before, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.07,0:15:31.16,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,What? I didn't!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Do I smell weird to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.45,0:15:34.66,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.29,0:15:41.75,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, I looked up to you a lot\Nbut you are {\i1}way{\i0} different than I imagined!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.09,0:15:43.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I know what you mean!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.80,0:15:49.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sorry! You're different than I imagined too.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.81,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're a really nice person.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.27,0:15:56.98,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, you dummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.98,0:15:58.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.61,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Is it hot in here, or is it just me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.44,0:16:04.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,There you go again, Sena!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.15,0:16:07.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Asahi-chan is such a meanie.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Kabappy-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.99,Default,All,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.50,0:16:15.50,Default,Kabappy,0,0,0,,Hullo.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.33,0:16:17.79,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,He's actually there!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.79,0:16:19.83,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Can hippos talk?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.83,0:16:20.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.58,0:16:24.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Kabappy's here too?\NWe're so doomed on this island...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.63,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's Kabappy-san... Am I dreaming?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.18,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Still no luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.18,0:16:34.68,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,How about up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.39,0:16:40.60,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Looks scary...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.86,0:16:50.41,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Gotta go home! Gotta go home!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.37,0:16:53.78,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.29,0:17:00.04,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,It's working here!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.04,0:17:02.17,Default,Azuki/Chapi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.34,0:17:07.46,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What will we do tomorrow?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.26,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,The sky's the limit.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.01,0:17:14.01,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Do you guys hear something?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.10,0:17:16.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.56,0:17:18.48,Default,Kabappy,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.48,0:17:20.73,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you hear?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.28,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.49,0:17:33.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,N-Now this is real survival, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Kabappy...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're so warm...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.75,0:17:42.04,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,No kidding. Puts you at ease...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.30,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Doesn't usually get this rough.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.55,0:17:58.02,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Oh, right. It's almost time for\Nthe Festival of Magic, ain't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.02,0:17:59.31,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,No wonder.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.44,0:18:02.14,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.85,0:18:04.65,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,They're asleep...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.02,0:18:06.19,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,A Kabappy...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.44,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,fairy?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.44,0:18:08.65,Default,Kabappy,0,0,0,,Hullo.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.07,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Everyone's asleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.07,0:18:13.16,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Let's wake them and bring them to the cliff.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.95,0:18:16.45,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up, Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.45,0:18:18.04,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,No good, she's deep asleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.58,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.54,Default,Kabappy,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.17,0:18:25.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.13,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,She's up!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.13,0:18:27.34,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Come, this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm still sleepy...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.89,0:18:37.35,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Don't fall asleep!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.68,0:18:38.97,Default,Kabappy,0,0,0,,Keep walking!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.23,0:18:46.77,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.40,0:18:49.02,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.02,0:18:50.36,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.36,0:18:53.82,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,The storm's approaching faster than I thought!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.82,0:18:55.53,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,We'd better get going.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.37,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It's coming down!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.41,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.83,0:19:04.04,Default,Fisherman,0,0,0,,The island's gonna go under soon,\Nso you'd better move somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.04,0:19:07.33,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,You can still use magic at the top of the cliff!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.46,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,When are you gonna wake up?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.46,0:19:10.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.59,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.59,0:19:14.13,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.90,0:19:33.19,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,There's still time!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.19,0:19:34.61,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.61,0:19:35.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.08,0:19:46.25,Default,Ffuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.87,0:19:50.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.94,0:20:10.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let us all go home!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.95,Default,Kabappy,0,0,0,,Here! Get on!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Kabappy! Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.71,0:20:32.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Everyone's here.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.09,0:20:35.84,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Uguisu, Azuki, take care! I had fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.84,0:20:38.72,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Chapi, I had fun too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.09,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.09,0:20:41.26,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,See you again!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.26,0:20:44.51,Default,Chapi,0,0,0,,Let's play again someday!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.06,0:20:47.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.76,0:21:18.92,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.55,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Time to wake up.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.47,0:21:26.97,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,So bright...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.97,0:21:28.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.85,0:21:30.77,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.56,0:21:34.69,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Was that all a dream?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.99,0:21:43.24,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.24,0:21:45.03,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Later, Chapi!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.17,0:21:55.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That was a weird dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.50,0:21:56.34,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.34,0:21:59.09,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I feel...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.71,0:22:01.01,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,kinda tired.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.01,0:22:02.68,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.34,0:22:05.97,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,But the fish tasted pretty good.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.97,0:22:08.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That was some survival.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.65,0:22:15.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Don't lean forward like that, it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.20,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Comment: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:07.04,Signs,,0,0,0,,The Storm on the Mysterious Island
