Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.70,0:22:28.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Et cetera cera...{エトセトラ　セラ}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.62,0:22:30.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}(Et cetera ce...){(エトセトラ　セ)}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.95,0:22:33.87,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Where do we start? (Do-re-mi-fa) We leave it up to God {どれから(ドレミファ)神様の言う(とおりじゃ)}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.91,0:22:35.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}But that's boring{つまんないから}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.87,0:22:36.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}So if I decide for myself{自分で選んだら}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.92,0:22:39.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}Start piling things on and it'll start to move{あれこれ　乗っけて　まわり出す}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:53.43,0:23:01.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}If I peer into the hearts of people passing by{すれちがう人　心を覗き込めたら}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:01.02,0:23:04.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}What are they dreaming of? They're sparkling and shining{どんな夢をみてる？キラキラ光って}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.32,0:23:09.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Just like precious jewels {宝石みたいに　大切な}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.41,0:23:15.58,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}If the fragments of dreams scattered around the world{世界中散らばる　夢のかけらたちをね}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.04,0:23:15.58,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Could be lined up{せんぶ並べ}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.58,0:23:22.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}And granted on the count of three, it'd be amazing{せーの！でかなえたら　アメイジング}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.17,0:23:24.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Dreams à la mode, for you{どりぃむアラモード For you}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.92,0:23:29.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I'll make our planet into a great big dessert dish{この星はきっと大きめの　デザートディッシュ}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:29.64,0:23:35.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Load it up with all your excitement, it's OK!{ときめきをありったけ　乗せてOK！なの！}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:35.27,0:23:36.94,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\an8}Yes it is!{なの！なの！}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:36.52,0:23:39.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Dreams à la mode, for you{どりぃむアラモード For you}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:39.27,0:23:43.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I'm sure there's colorful, sweet spells in store{カラフルでスイートな魔法　きっとあるはず}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:43.48,0:23:46.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Try believing it, and tomorrow will be a good day{信じてみてって　あしたはGood day}
