Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:39.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Dreams à la mode, for you{どりぃむアラモード For you}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.27,0:23:43.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}I'm sure there's colorful, sweet spells in store{カラフルでスイートな魔法　きっとあるはず}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:46.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Try believing it, and tomorrow will be a good day{信じてみてって　あしたはGood day}
